age: 13-85
per_year: 0 0 0 0 0 0
gap: 10-40
times: World event: censors_close (sphere learn). Selector place: after complaints, books are pulled and topics forbidden in the town's schools; about 3 in 10 of the people living there, pupils, parents and readers, meet it as a choice of their own (share .3, estimate), once or twice in a life (estimate)
likelier: a fearful season after unrest, a zealous council, a pupil or parent who reads
rarer: calm years with free speech, a person with no tie to the schools
tone: trouble
life: school, community, law
horizon: months
roles: mentor, parent, friend, teacher
earth: after complaints the council pulls a dozen books from the school library, and the teachers are told which topics to avoid
